# @name: docker | Tag Docker Image
# @description: Tags a Docker image Group: Docker Image Management. Template: replace placeholders before running. {source_image} = Source image name | {source_tag} = Source image tag [default "latest"] | {target_image} = Target image name | {target_tag} = Target image tag [default "latest"]
docker tag {source_image}:{source_tag} {target_image}:{target_tag}